# every later group with the trailer before it. Then commit b7 (the group that did not fit log.1), a lease, a
# reservation whose bulk commit never lands, the checkpoint that retires extent 1 into hist.2 (EX-4, EX-5), and a gc
# checkpoint that replaces hist.2 by its rewrite hist.5.

